window.products.push({"id":768021,"name":"KaleaBoutique 2-Pack KB Adjustable Divider Under Bed Storage Shoe Organizer Bin, 24 Pair Foldable Closet Shoe Storage Box, Flex Space Storage Bin, Dou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+CnscZKML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton shell, non-woven lining Thick Vinyl Cover: Protect your shoes from dust and dirt with our see-through clear vinyl cover. The See-Through cover makes it easy to find clothes or pair of shoes you want without opening and searching throughout the box. The easy to clean waterproof cover protects from dust, dirt and moisture provides a clear view of what is inside. Large storage capacity: Our set of 2 shoe storage organizers provides room for 24 pairs of shoes (12 pairs per bin). No more piles of shoes on a floor, or dusty pairs stored on shelves. Each bin comes with a fold-up rigid floor insert, 1 long Velcro divider and 10 cross way Velcro dividers, that can be adjusted or removed for the most custom fit. Use the bin set not just for shoes and boots, but for clothes, linens, seasonal items and more. High quality materials: We use only the highest quality materials in the construction of under bed shoe storage organizers. The outer shell is made from soft cotton while the inside is lined with the most durable 120g non-woven fabric. The bin walls feature rigid and strong waterproof plastic poly boards (not cheap and flimsy recycled cardboard) - this provides extra durability and longevity to the overall construction. Easy to move and store: These bins are worry-free and durable. You can easily pull and slide your shoe organizer thanks to the reinforced riveted handles located in the front and on both sides of the bin. The eco-friendly soft cotton outer shell provides good air flow. The shoe containers are foldable. Just fold-up it up and store when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+CnscZKML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KaleaBoutique","source_asin":"B0BHPVM78X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHPVM78X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHPVM78X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":768022,"name":"nuLOOM Animal World Map Kids Area Rug, 5' x 7' 5\", Baby Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xvvylV2NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At nuLOOM, we believe that floor coverings and art should not be mutually exclusive. Founded with a desire to break the rules of what is expected from an area rug, nuLOOM was created to fill the void between brilliant design and affordability., The images we display have the most accurate colors possible.Rug Colors, sizes, patterns may vary slightly depending on how your rug is made and the size ordered.Due to different monitor resolutions and lighting you may notice a slight difference in color. Each handmade rug is unique to the artisan who weaved it.These are not considered defects Bunching, Creases and Folded Corners: You may see some creases and bunching in the pile and around the corners when you unroll your new rug. These waves will flatten within 2 -3 weeks as you begin to use your new rug. Use these tricks to help flatten your rug: Back Rolling: Roll the carpet out, then roll it back up reversely with the backside up. Let it sit rolled up reversely for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. Heavy Objects: Lay a piece of heavy furniture or objects on affected areas for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. If the corners are sticking up, curl them back and place heavy objects on affected areas going the opposite way. Heat: Use this technique as a last resort only. Place the rug over a cleared concrete or area like a driveway or sidewalk setting during dry sunny conditions. Allow the rug to be positioned for optimal sunlight as long as possible to give the rug time to absorb the sun's heat for up to 2 hours, but use more time if needed. Blow Dryer: If a large concrete patch with optimal sunlight is not accessible, flip the rug over and use a hair dryer to affected areas to heat up the creases. Always hold the hair dryer 7 to 12 inches away from the rug going side to side on a medium setting, as heat can sometimes cause backing to melt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xvvylV2NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B07WNYLZ51","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WNYLZ51","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WNYLZ51","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
