window.products.push({"id":768109,"name":"HuaLan Colorful Fiberglass Chopsticks, Dishwasher Safe Chopstick, Reusable Non-slip Chop Sticks, Lightweight Chopsticks 9 1/2 Inches, 5 Pairs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QJm1hktDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ღHealthy material: Our fiberglass chopsticks are made of food-grade polymer fiberglass. Unlike cheap plastic chopsticks, fiberglass chopsticks do not contain wax, BPA, formaldehyde; no paint, no coating. The method of distinguishing fiberglass chopsticks and plastic chopsticks: the real fiberglass chopsticks have a crisp sound when knocked, while low-quality plastic chopsticks have a dull sound. ღReusable: Bamboo chopsticks and plastic chopsticks will become moldy, cracked and easily contaminated with bacteria after long-term use. Our fiberglass chopsticks have the characteristics of high density, high temperature resistance and corrosion resistance, so they can be reused, and prevents chopsticks from getting stained and going bad when in contact with food, bring you a healthy life! ღElegant and Practical Design: Our chopsticks are comfortable to hold, the chopstick body is designed with non-slip texture; the tips are engraved with dense texture for a better grip on food; hexagon body design will avoid chopsticks from falling down from table while not using, really friendly to beginners and frequent users. Customize your own chopsticks for one person and one colour, suitable for families, restaurants, and travel. ღProduct Features: Our products can withstand the high temperature of 356 ℉（180℃）and can resist the corrosion of strong acids and alkalines. They can be sterilized with boiling water or sterilized in a sterilization cabinet. No melting, breaking or deformation, easy to clean, no residue, no mold. Easy to clean, they can be washed by hand or dishwasher. ღFunctional Use: Our chopsticks are not only suitable for all kinds of Asian food such as, rice, hot pot, ramen, dumplings, sushi, Korean fried chicken, Japanese sushi, General Tso's chicken, Kung Pao chicken, Vietnamese Spring rolls, salads, are also suitable for western food, like spaghetti, tonkatsu, BBQ, etc. Our chopsticks also can be used as holiday gifts among families and friends, birthday gifts, company annual meeting prizes with a gift package.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QJm1hktDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HuaLan","source_asin":"B089SW5PH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089SW5PH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089SW5PH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
