window.products.push({"id":768248,"name":"Wood Wine Bottle Glasses Caddy - Beer Carrier - Drinking Desk Accessories - Craft 4 Pack bottle Case - Men's Wine Organizer - Glass tray holder - Wine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mj102QgkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What’s better than a bottle of your favorite wine? Two bottles of your favorite wine and a couple of glasses in a wooden, collapsible wine crate that you can also use as a wine glass drying rack. A true definition of vintage style and timeless elegance from Rostmarygift. Need a gift idea for the beer/wine lover in your life? Show that you care with a handcrafted wood rustic bottle 4-pack holder for outdoor events. Let them add a touch of practicability to the fun – be it a summer BBQ with family, a picnic with your high school besties, a boat/road trip or a tailgate party. Make this Father’s Day, Christmas Day, Anniversary or special event unforgettable with a handmade wine box and beer bag. The craft bottle case and wine glasses serving table is handcrafted, with keen attention to detail and a smooth, wooden finish glazed with protective stain-resistant teak oil. Our tabletop wood wine holder is strong, steady and all wooden – no glue, screw or nails. Inside, you’ll find full assembly instructions so you can get the party started in no time. Set the bar high and display your favorite bottles with a ideal décor handmade men’s wine organizer that’s also handy as a wine bottle rack, bottle dock, beer bottle tote and a storage liquor picnic. If you love practicality, you’ll love our product. It comes with free coasters - desk phone holders and a magnetic corkscrew holder. Also usable as a fit four bottles wine crate with glass drying rack, it collapsible for portability and easy to assemble for convenience. Try our rustic wooden beer Caddy/Carrier with built-in magnetic cap catch today. Accessories shown in the pictures are not included in the set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mj102QgkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROSTMARYGIFT","source_asin":"B0891TB6WL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0891TB6WL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0891TB6WL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
