window.products.push({"id":768353,"name":"Mini Bag Sealer, Cheweetty Handheld Heat Vacuum Sealer, Upgraded 2 IN 1 Heat Sealer & Cutter USB Rechargeable, Portable Resealer Machine Kitchen Gadge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S4VcV-1EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Upgraded 2 IN 1 Heat Sealer & Cutter】As a more efficient solution to bag clips, Cheweetty bag sealer mini is made of high quality ABS material, which makes it stable, durable, resist high temperature and easily seal(via rotating the knob to “+”) and cut plastic bags and food storage bags(via rotating the knob to “-” ). Between \"+\" and \"-\", it enters security lock mode to prevent accidental press. It is an essential kitchen accessory for you! 【Food Storage & Freshness】The chip bag sealer helps you storage leftover foods, snacks, fruits and so on. It can avoid waste, mould growth and keep foods freshness and taste. This plastic bag sealer is suitable for chip bags, vacuum sealer bags, cookie bags, pet food bags and other PP, PE, PVC bags (Plastic bags with a thickness of 0.3mm or less are recommended). Not for cling film, cellophane bags, kraft paper bags, pure alumimum bags. 【Upgraded Design & USB Rechargeable】Different from those bag sealers that need chemical AA batteries, this mini bag sealer is much more environmentally friendly and money saving due to equipped with a capacity of 400mAh rechargeable li-on battery. USB rechargeable and rotateable knob design makes the plastic bag sealer exquisite, practical and safe to use. 【Preheat Free & Safe Use】With updated technical, this bag sealer heat seal is very easy to use without preheating. When you rotate the knob to '-' for sealing, press the knob, the high-efficiency and low-loss heating film will instantly reach the sealing temperature. Then place the bag to be sealed in the middle and slide it along the edge at a constant speed for airtight sealing. Its security lock mode makes it much more safe. 【Portable & Convenient】The vacuum sealer bag is small, lightweight and portable, with a magnetic sheet on the back. It can be wonderfully used on various occasions such as kitchen, fishing, camping, travel, bedroom, etc. You can easily stick this portable snack bag heat sealer to the refrigerator or store it in a drawer easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S4VcV-1EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheweetty","source_asin":"B0B82FG9QJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B82FG9QJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B82FG9QJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
