window.products.push({"id":768558,"name":"Crow Canyon - Enamelware Pasta Plates - Set of 4 - Grey on White Marble","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uvSDx5K2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Entertain guests and feast on a meal with these durable, vintage pasta plates! Measuring 10.5\", these plates are perfect for serving up heaping piles of pasta. From chic wedding tableware to everyday usage and camping adventures, each piece of Crow Canyon Home enamelware is both durable and versatile. They're lightweight and shatterproof, making them great for kids and use in the outdoors. Each item is easy to clean and entirely food safe, even when chipped, so you can enjoy it for years to come. Handmade with a Commitment to Traditional Standards of Quality. Each piece of Crow Canyon Home enamelware is tested by an independent laboratory to meet both FDA and California Food Safety regulations. Everything is handmade in Asia using a meticulous process to ensure the best possible quality. Traditionally created using extremely high heat, each piece of enamelware begins by fusing porcelain onto a steel base and hand-dipping it multiple times, making it safe for the oven and most heat sources (excluding the microwave). The unique marble pattern on the splatterware models is then splattered across the piece by flicking a special brush over it, making each piece a one-of-a-kind treasure. Care & Use Instructions: All Crow Canyon Home Enamelware is dishwasher safe and okay to use on a grill, stovetop, campfire, or in an oven. Enamelware is NOT intended for microwave use. Avoid using abrasive cleansers or hard water stain removers on its surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uvSDx5K2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crow Canyon Home","source_asin":"B06Y2NPKLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y2NPKLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y2NPKLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
