window.products.push({"id":768619,"name":"Dress My Cupcake 200-Piece Tissue Paper, 20 by 14-Inch, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31fz3bk+EDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Dress My Cupcake is the world's largest manufacturer of designer cupcake wrappers. We also manufacture vibrant candy buffet decorations, such as our Diamond Rhinestone Ribbon Wrap. Our Rhinestone Ribbon Wrap and other party decorations perfectly match our exclusive line of designer cupcake wrappers. Dress My Cupcake offers cupcake wrappers in over 500 different colors and styles that are best-sellers, worldwide. Dress My Cupcake's designer wrappers and products have been featured in platinum events hosted by clients such as the Four Seasons Hotel, CBS and the Miami Dolphins. Our cupcake wrappers provide an elegant look to your cupcakes by hiding wrinkly cupcake liners. Our wrappers can be found at all types of special events, including weddings, bridal showers, baby showers, birthdays, college events, bar and bat mitzvahs, corporate events, Hollywood galas and more. Cupcake wrappers are for presentation only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31fz3bk+EDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dress My Cupcake","source_asin":"B009USWTI4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009USWTI4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009USWTI4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":768620,"name":"Chef's Star Premium Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set with Adjustable Grind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N5Skr3MRL._AC_SL1374_.jpg","description":"Chef's Star Premium 2 in 1 Automatic Salt and Pepper Mill Grinder with Adjustable Grind Add more spice to your life with the premium 2-in-1 automatic salt and pepper mill grinder from Chef’s Star! The stainless steel finish and crystal clear acrylic viewing windows offer a high end, luxury look that you can proudly display in your kitchen and bring to any party table. Easily fill the mill with flavorful rock or sea salt and spicy peppercorns for a fresh grind every time. The clearly labeled S and P push buttons are located on the top of the grinding mill for easy access. Simply push the button and enjoy automated grinding as the razor sharp internal ceramic grinders spin and release the perfect dose of spice and flavor to top your dishes. The ceramic grinders are designed to keep their edge without dulling and deliver a consistent texture with smooth, precise operation; plus, unlike metal blade designs, these ceramic grinders will never rust or corrode. Make the grind your own and adjust the settings to match your personal preferences. The mill holds plenty of salt and pepper to serve your family for months at a time, but it’s also incredibly easy to refill when you've used it all up! Flavor your dishes anywhere, anytime and enjoy the convenience, style, and consistency of battery-powered automatic grinding to bring salt and pepper to a new level of freshness and fun. Features Sleek design that is elegant for your dining table so you have the convenience of adding more flavor to your food as you dine. Perfect for food preparations in your kitchen. Simple to refill and use. Also easy to clean. Designed to last with durable materials in a lightweight design","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N5Skr3MRL._AC_SL1374_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef's Star","source_asin":"B00UZDTP4Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UZDTP4Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UZDTP4Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":768621,"name":"Natural Dried Pampas Grass, 60Pcs Pampas Grass Decor, Pompous Reed Grass Plants Boho Decor Wedding Decorations Boho Pampas Grass Flower Arrangements H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YKdWrgvIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💐100% QUALITY ASSURANCE : HEIGHT : Pampas grass is about 45 cm(17.5in) , the length of the flower pole is about 25-30cm(9.8in-11.8in) MORE THAN ONE KIND OF POMPOUS GRASS BOUQUET: carefully selected natural dried pampas grass decor, try to avoid deformation and breakage of dried pampas grass. You can match it with different dried pompass floral bouquets according to your preference 💐Product Specifications:Contains 42 dusters, 5 small white reeds, 5 small brown reeds, 8 bunny tails; The total height of the dandelion grass is about 43CM. You can use these pampas grass to create a beautiful mood.suitable for small and medium-sized pampas grass vase, fall vase filler have natural color overall elegance Smooth, warm color palette has an autumnal atmosphere 💐WARM NOTICE : When you receive our pampas, shedding is normal because of 100% natural dried flowers, so you can put your pampas under the sun for a few hours, which will make pampas very fluffy (the effect in the picture), then you can put it in your vase to decorate your home. 💐CHIC MINIMALIST HOME DECOR : Our pampas grass decor is a simple and effective element that adds a touch of freshness to your place. With warm and natural colors that turn any corner into a cozy nook, our dried grass is the best choice for those who want a boho chic element of decor in their homes. Simply put it in a vase or jar for a simple and elegant decoration display. It suits your boho room decors and look luxurious at same time. 💐FOR YOUR LOVED ONES: Our pampas look amazing in any type of home or office,it's a wonderful housewarming, Christmas, birthday, or anniversary gift for your family and friends, and this gift will keep for a long long time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YKdWrgvIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ainiyou","source_asin":"B0B84KWRT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B84KWRT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B84KWRT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":768622,"name":"Spectrum Diversified Scroll Mini Fruit Bowl, Classic Kitchen Design for Produce Storage Basket Holder, Countertop Décor & Kitchen Organization, Tradit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.06,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NuXLQEWnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Display your farmer’s market haul in Spectrum Diversified’s Scroll Mini Fruit Bowl. Store all your favorites: apples, oranges, plums, pears, bananas, avocados, tomatoes, and more all fit comfortably inside the sturdy metal bowl. The open wire not only looks fantastic on countertops, but it also encourages even ripening of produce. Open wire design allows ethylene gas to circulate, encouraging even ripening in fruit. Air circulation also prevents buildup of ethylene gas, so your fruits will stay fresh for longer as the gas causes produce to continue ripening even after it’s reached maturity. Wire storage limits overripening, expanding the window in which you can enjoy your fruits and vegetables. The classic scroll design swirls with an enduring, timeless style. The elegant scrolls cast a sense of luxurious charm and grace that characterizes classic taste. Refined, grand, and sophisticated, this organizer will exude style in your kitchen. Feet raise the bowl off the kitchen countertop, bar surface, or dining table to protect contents from spills and splatters. The rounded feet will not scratch or scuff the counters, and they are evenly spaced to eliminate tipping and wobbling. Made of sturdy steel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NuXLQEWnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spectrum Diversified","source_asin":"B082YVKWQ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082YVKWQ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082YVKWQ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
