window.products.push({"id":768694,"name":"Ourokhome Plastic Whiskey Cooling Cup, 2 Set Ice Chilling Liquor Glasses for Bourbon and Scotch, 5 oz White Wine Insulator Freeze Tumbler for Men and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EnmVZcPlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Making iced whiskey without dilution: If you like the original taste of whiskey and you don’t like the water down drinks, you may probably have searched for many ways to keep your wine cool, now our freeze whiskey glasses is your best choice. No more worrying about your wine being water down as ice cube melts, and it will keep your whiskey cool for more than 2 hours, not freezer cold, but drinkable cold. You will enjoy the last drop of whiskey as rich as the first bite. An automatic whiskey cooler: This is the only automatic whiskey frozen cup that offers to serve your wine cold. The commonly whiskey glasses in the market need to add ice cube or ice ball to reach the perfect temperature, but our frozen cup don’t. This all thanks to our special double wall design, the bottom of the cup can be unscrewed, and the inside can be filled with water, frozen in the refrigerator for 4-8 hours, the water will be frozen into ice, the ice will continue to chill your wine. Don't worry about gel leaks anymore: Many whiskey cups on the market are filled with gel, which will leak and cause safety problems after several freezes. Our fancy wine tumbler chill your avid drinks by ice, which is harmless and environmentally friendly. Insulated walls filled with ice works as a wine chiller when frozen, You don't need to change the water inside every day, we recommend changing it every 3 days. And the whiskey cups are top rack dishwasher safe. Keep your drinks cold more than 2 hours: Our Whiskey tumbler cooler not only for whiskey, but also for bourbon, scotch, red and white wine, tequila, White Russian cinnamon whiskey and more other drinks. It will keep your wine cold for 2 hours at room temperature of 80℉. Serve your wine cool down quickly: When the environment temperature is 80 and your wine is 68 ℉, pour your wine into our chilled whiskey glass, it will drop to 59 ℉ in 1 minute, to 50℉ in 2 minutes. The latest patented design: Maybe you wonder if the water in whiskey chiller will spill, we have considered your concerns, so we have designed a silicone pressure release valve on the bottom lid, which it will buffer the increase in volume as water turns to ice. Super simper to use whiskey tumbler: Twist and take off the bottom base, fill with water until flush with the base of lining inner bottom, then screw on the bottom lid tightly, put the freezer cup to refrigerator to freeze for 4-8 hours. Awesome gift for cold drink lovers: Our patent iced whiskey cups brings you a new chilling experience and applicable to any scene at any time. We have designed exquisite packaging, it will be a perfect gifts for father’s day, Mother's Day, wedding, engagement, retirement, house warming for new home, Thanksgiving day, Christmas gifts, white elephant gifts and any other gift for dad, mom, grandpa, grandma, brother, sister, husband, wife, friends and anyone else you want to give a gift to. Superior quality of whiskey cup: Plastic construction is sturdy, anti-slip design at the bottom makes the whiskey cooler stable enough. The silicone grip around the glass not only makes for the comfortable handing, but also keep your hands from getting too cold once the water freezes. All the material are BPA free. Gift contained: 2 silicone coasters include to avoid leaving ugly condensation rings on your expensive furniture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EnmVZcPlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ourokhome","source_asin":"B0BJ8SPS6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ8SPS6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ8SPS6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
