window.products.push({"id":768743,"name":"Oversize Premium Quality Bath Towels, Extra Large 40x80 Inches, 100% Soft Turkish Cotton","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A13sp0EuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you been looking for high quality and lush bath towel at an economical price? If so, you have landed on the right Listing! These Extra Large Bath Towels (40x80 inches) are imported from Turkey, a country that is famous for its high quality textiles and towels. These bath sheets are made of 100% absorbent cotton and do not contain any harmful dyes. No dangerous chemical solvents are used in post production. In fact, we are certified by an external regulator. These premium bath towels are VAT dyed, which is a safe and durable process of dying in which yarns are held under a high temperature and pressure for 6-12 hours. This way, the pigment can be really steeped and infused into the towel which limits any fading and improves the overall durability of the product. We do not use any bleach when washing these bath sheets. We deeply value our customers and we are confident in our product. If you are not satisfied with these bath sheets for any reason at all, just return them hassle-free through Amazon within 30 days for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A13sp0EuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TURKUOISE TURKISH TOWEL","source_asin":"B07FZ8DH77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FZ8DH77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FZ8DH77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":768744,"name":"Oster TSSTTVF817 Innovative Extra Large 6 Slice Convection Toaster Oven Countertop Appliance, Black Housing with Stainless Steel Front","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712luXWK2TL._AC_SL1192_.jpg","description":"This Oster Convection Toaster Oven is your 1-stop-shop for all of your toasting, baking, and broiling needs. Designed with food lovers in mind, this toaster oven is easy to use with adjustable temperature and cook settings. Simply add your meal to the oven, select your cooking function, set a timer, and let the appliance do the rest. Extra powerful convection heating technology provides a faster and more even cook within every use. When you've finished your culinary masterpiece, cleaning this indoor oven has never been easier. Both the oven rack and the baking tray easily slide out, making room for a quick wipe down inside and out. Once you've tidied up, simply put each component back into place and this portable appliance will be ready to go for your next meal. Simplify cooking with the Oster Convection Toaster Oven.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712luXWK2TL._AC_SL1192_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oster","source_asin":"B079V2B2N3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079V2B2N3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079V2B2N3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
