window.products.push({"id":768848,"name":"Besswin Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 280W 25Kpa Powerful Suction Stick Vacuum Cleaner with 2200mAh Battery Up to 35min Runtime, 4 in 1 Lightweight Handhel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615F0KZC7lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Besswin W20 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner Will Be Your Best Cleaning Partner, Meets All Your Cleaning Demands. 【Impressive 25000pa Strong Suction】 W20 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner adopt upgrade 280W BRUSHLESS motor, generates a high-speed airflow to provide 25000 pa crazy suction in max mode, picks up debris, crumbs and pet hairs instantly. And ensures comparatively quiet working environment, giving you a quiet cleaning experience. 【Excellent Upgraded Battery】 7-Cell battery of 2200mAh large capacity battery inside support the stick vacuum with an outstanding running time up to 35mins at 12kpa, 20mins at powerful 25kpa suction for all round home cleaning, easy to disassemble and take it out for charging, you can get spare packs to extend the runtime. 【5 Stages Filtration System】Captures 99.99% of fine particles as small as 0.1um , high-efficiency 5-stage fully sealed cyclone filtration system and latest 5 concentric cyclone groups, offers powerful centrifugul force to efficiently separate dirt, provides the ultimate purified air. Note: The stick cordless vacuum HEPA filter device is washable, please cleaning filter/sponge frequently to keep suction and prevent blockage. 【LED Flem Floor Brush】 150°swivels sideways and 90°up&down could clean your home in all directions; Featured LED lights to keep every dark corners cleaning, such as dirt under furniture. Adopt professional roller and two wheels, move easily on the floor and protects your carpets and hard floors. 【4 in 1 Lightweight Versatile 】Conversion easily between stick vacuum and handheld vacuum cleaner, equipped with multiple accessories to reach corners, stairs crevices and the cars. Lightweight and convenient, easy to use for the elderly and children. 【1.2L Large Capacity Collecting All】 Extra large 1.2 L dustbin with one press button for easy empty and can captures dirt and pet hair without leakage. Sufficient for several rooms and car cleanings instead of frequent emptying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615F0KZC7lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Besswin","source_asin":"B09NW4PYQL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NW4PYQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NW4PYQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":768849,"name":"Best Manufacturers 8-sw Whisk, 8\", Natural Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61atYXU0rZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Best Manufacturers Inc., a family business, has designed and fabricated the highest quality, most sanitary professional whisks and mashers in Portland, Oregon since 1959. With roots in the restaurant supply industry, Best supplies the same durable cooking tools required by the rigors of the professional kitchen to the home cook.  Best Whips are also manufactured to the sanitary specifications of the National Sanitation Foundation (NSF), the recognized authority in professional kitchen tools and kitchen equipment. As a third generation specialty manufacturer/distributor, Best is proud to offer a large selection of Made in America products as well as products from Mexico, Germany and China.  Distributed products are selected with the same professional standard, consistent with our reputation as a manufacturer of fine kitchen tools. Amazon.com With its comfortable design and professional-grade construction, this Best Manufacturers French whip is the tool to use for quick, daily whisking jobs. Sized for emulsifying small quantities and blending in measuring cups, the piece features elongated wires fastened securely to a metal-banded wooden handle. The wires are epoxy-sealed for sanitation, and the weighted handle is smooth, comfortable, and strong. Safe in the dishwasher, the whip is 8 inches long and made in Portland, Oregon. It also comes in larger versions for bigger tasks. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61atYXU0rZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best Manufacturers","source_asin":"B00004YQU8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-768849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004YQU8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004YQU8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
